OL,3,AOpenAI boss says world 'right to be
OL,4,Aafraid' but should trust AI firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of ChatGPT maker Open AI says
OL,7,Fpeople should have more faith in his
OL,8,Ffirm and others like it to do the right
OL,9,Fthing when it comes to artificial
OL,10,Fintelligence (AI) development amid
OL,11,Frising public concerns about the risks.
OL,13,F"The world should trust that we are
OL,14,Fgoing to do the right thing because
OL,15,Fit's the right thing and we feel the
OL,16,Fmagnitude of this," Sam Altman said on
OL,17,FTuesday during a conference in San
OL,18,FFrancisco.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
